data: {"id": "5218f6e860c1447e-final", "run_id": "5218f6e860c1447e", "seq": 723, "ts_ms": 1789042940639, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器 app 无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ImagePullBackOff` | 确认 Pod 处于镜像拉取失败并进入指数退避的状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed`: `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 证明核心原因是域名 `registry.invalid` 解析失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因无法就绪而被调度器保持在 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (app, ImagePullBackOff): `1` | 独立观测确认等待原因为镜像拉取失败 |\n\n**证据互证分析**：\n事实 #2 提供了决定性的错误堆栈，指出 DNS 解析失败是导致镜像拉取失败的根本原因；事实 #1 和 #4 从容器状态和指标层面独立确认了 `ImagePullBackOff` 的现象。事实 #3 说明该故障导致 Pod 无法完成启动。日志与 Tracing 因容器未启动而未产生数据，符合预期。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效域名 `registry.invalid` 作为镜像地址 → DNS 解析失败 (no such host) 导致无法连接镜像仓库 → kubelet 反复拉取镜像报错并进入指数退避 → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 和 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置了无效的镜像域名 `registry.invalid`。\n\n该域名的 DNS 解析失败导致 kubelet 无法从镜像仓库拉取镜像，从而触发了 Kubernetes 的 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。此结论由 Kubernetes 事件的错误日志（`no such host`）以及容器等待原因（`ImagePullBackOff`）直接支持。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 71.7s (Evidence 63.8s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.377, "metrics": {"run_id": "5218f6e860c1447e", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.38519430160522, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 91385.19430160522, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 66274.31011199951, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 22, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 31729.322910308838, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 24788.32983970642}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12592.073678970337, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 71729.14862632751, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7040.196180343628, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

